{"meta":{"id":"dm.aHR0cDovL3NlcnZlcjEuZGhha2Ftb3ZpZS5jb20vTW92aWVzL0hvbGx5d29vZC8yMDAwLS0yMDEwL0xvY2FsJTIwQm95cyUyMCUyODIwMDIlMjkv","type":"movie","name":"Local Boys","poster":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342/juIgKEqJQzXxUMdiVYjy2F24Lva.jpg","background":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/vsAedktA3maMvHpSHrQ0g4z5bBa.jpg","description":"On Skeet’s twelfth birthday his older brother Randy buys him his first surfboard. Suddenly his summer turns to the endless search for the perfect wave, wild times and beach parties and eventually, finding his own daring adventures when Randy’s attention turns to a girl. Beyond his wildest dreams, Skeet is taken under the wings of surfing legend Jim Wesley who gives Skeet first-hand lessons in hot-dogging. Meanwhile, Randy, still dealing with the loss of his father and trying to fill his shoes, is jealous of Jim’s influence on Skeet and isn’t thrilled when Jim begins a relationship with their single mom. Tangled by the conflict between his brother and his newfound father figure, Skeet retreats to his room while longing to surf.\n\nRated PG-13 · Released 23 Feb 2002 · United States of America · Language: English · 102 min\nStudio: Capstone Pictures\n\nOn your server — Audio: English · Subtitle files: English","releaseInfo":"2002","genres":["Drama","Hollywood"],"imdbRating":"6.4","runtime":"102 min","cast":["Mark Harmon","Eric Christian Olsen","Stacy Edwards","Jeremy Sumpter","Lukas Behnken","Giuseppe Andrews","Natalie Ramsey","Shelby Fenner"],"director":["Ron Moler"],"released":"2002-02-23T00:00:00.000Z","slogan":"Dream The Extreme","app_extras":{"cast":[{"name":"Ron Moler","character":"Director"},{"name":"Mark Harmon","character":"Jim Wesley","photo":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w185/jDRXlmBItH9IyXk9UhafpOSBIq7.jpg"},{"name":"Eric Christian Olsen","character":"Randy Dobson","photo":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w185/v6r77LimgA49VxsRjKVFUYeVVRi.jpg"},{"name":"Stacy Edwards","character":"Jessica Dobson","photo":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w18